{'symbol': 'BALL', 'date': '2022-11-09 17:35:00', 'title': 'BALL CORPORATION ANNOUNCES PRICING OF $750 MILLION OF SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'WESTMINSTER, COLO. , NOV. 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BALL CORPORATION ("BALL") (NYSE: BALL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT PRICED AN UNDERWRITTEN PUBLIC OFFERING OF $750 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 6.875% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2028 (THE "NOTES").'}